 Compile_test;targetdir;openapidir;schemaname;schema;nsname

 ⍝ Test if Compile compiles all schemas
 targetdir←'./APLSource/Tests/TestClasses'
 openapidir←'./APLSource/Tests/TestData'
 targetdir(0 Try ##.##.Compile)openapidir
 Assert(≢##.TestClasses.(⎕NL ¯9.1))=≢⊃⎕NINFO⍠1⊢openapidir,'/*.json'

 ⍝ Test if all components and paths were compiled into classes
 schemaname←'petstore-expanded'
 nsname←'-(.)'⎕R'\u1'⊢'-',schemaname
 schema←⎕JSON⊃⎕NGET openapidir,'/',schemaname,'.json'
 Assert(≢##.TestClasses⍎nsname,'.components.schemas.(⎕NL ¯9.4)')=≢schema.components.schemas.(⎕NL ¯9)
 Assert(≢##.TestClasses⍎nsname,'.paths.(⎕NL ¯9)')=≢schema.paths.(⎕NL ¯9)

 3 ⎕NDELETE targetdir
